        "media_caption": "",
        "content": "<h2>Introducing the best nighttime eye serum around, and our newest product, Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum. </h2><p>Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum is the first product addition to our iconic Jet Lag Collection, following our award-winning and community-loved Jet Lag Mask. Just like Jet Lag Mask, this under eye serum was formulated to leave the skin feeling ultra-hydrated, soothed, and nourished.</p>",
        "content_smaller": "<p>This rich, emollient nighttime eye serum helps to visibly minimize fine lines for a smoother, firmer look with regular use. Powered by super-hydrating glycerin, barrier-supporting ceramides and a gentle retinoid blend, it works hard overnight to nourish and hydrate the eye area while you’re sleeping for the ultimate well-rested appearance. Like all of our products, this under eye serum is non-comedogenic, so you don’t have to worry about waking up to clogged pores.</p>",
        "content_left": "",
